    "jobDescription": "<div> <div style=\"clear:both;\"> <p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;line-height:normal;\"> </p></div><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">Company Overview</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:medium;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">At Synamedia, we’re a global team of 800+ trailblazers across 17 countries, revolutionizing how the world is entertained and informed.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:medium;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Synamedia helps many of the world’s leading operators and media companies create, deliver and monetise next-generation video experiences across mobile and big screen. Combining integrated platforms, cloud innovation and trusted operational expertise, Synamedia enables customers to grow audiences, increase engagement, and accelerate digital transformation.</span></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:medium;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Our solutions have been built over the last three decades and are trusted by giants like Astro, Sky, be IN Sports, Vodafone, OSN, Etisalat and many more.</span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Ready to grow with us and shape the future of media and entertainment solutions? Let’s do it together!</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-weight:bolder;font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">About the Job – Software Engineer (Cloud Development)</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">We are looking for a passionate Cloud engineer and enthusiastic problem solvers to be a key part of the Cloud development group in Bangalore who can help us in building and maintaining Synamedia GO product and Infinite suite of solutions.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Synamedia Go is an OTT video platform that enables Pay TV Operators, Telcos, Broadcasters, OTT Services, and content rights owners to launch and manage compelling video experiences to any device, anywhere, at any time. The product uses cutting edge technology and is in the forefront of Synamedia’s growth engines.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">We look towards you as an experienced Cloud engineer with good understanding of scalable and distributed microservices development and deployment in Agile Dev Ops environment. Your role would be to design, develop, deploy solutions applying your excellent programming and skills for the next generation of products and solutions in the domain of Video streaming. </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><br /></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-weight:bolder;font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Key Responsibilities</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-weight:bolder;font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Your day to day job includes technology evaluations, proof of concepts development, writing code, code reviews, continuous integration, continuous deployment, automated testing.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•You will be part of development team responsible for building and managing microservices for the platform.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•You will develop high quality software where continuous deployment, automated tests and rapid releases are the norm.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•You will work in highly collaborative environment in a multi-site setting</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Analyse Product and Customer requirements, mapping to existing solutions and suggesting new ideas. </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Suggest improvements into the product based on Quality and Stability, develop tools, scripts, or processes to drive efficiency and automation.</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><br /></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-weight:bolder;font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Technical Expertise </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-weight:bolder;font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Engineering graduate, B.E Computer Science or equivalent, with 2+ years industry experience</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Demonstrable experience as a Cloud Developer or similar role </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Worked on loosely coupled design, Microservices development, Message queues and containerized applications deployment using technologies like RESTful APIs and services and Docker</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Excellent programming knowledge and experience in Node JS, Java, Go Lang</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•At least 2 years experience with Cloud Technologies – AWS, EKS, Open stack (or similar), and building production grade solutions using AWS services such as Lambda, EC2, ECS, ELB, Route53, Cloud watch, VPC, IAM, Cognito </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Experience with Dev Ops, CI/CD pipeline with detailed understanding of Git, Jenkins, AWS pipeline, Artifactory, and Terraform is desirable</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Exposure to Continuous monitoring and Observability tools – Lightstep, Elasticsearch, Logstash, Kibana (ELK), Prometheus, Grafana </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Experience in using a key database technology such as RDS, My SQL, Mongo DB, Cassandra or Couchbase</span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><font><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">•Experience working with high volume, high throughput, cloud based systems is a plus. </span></font></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">Growth Opportunities</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">When welcoming new talent into the team, we are always looking for opportunities to bring in new ideas, those who ask challenging questions and have the curiosity to learn. These qualities are important to us as we nurture a culture of innovation, seize more opportunities to partner with our customers and make a difference as we transform the future of video. To further support your growth and that of our talent pool, Synamedia offers an exhaustive library of skill enhancement resources from AWS, Skill Soft and other partners to help you upskill while on the job. Be it data analytics that piques your brain or content creation, there’s something for every kind of mind.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><br /></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">Benefits and Perks</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"padding-left:0pt;margin:0pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);\"><li style=\"font-family:serif;margin-left:28.06pt;text-align:justify;padding-left:7.94pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Flexible working arrangements.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></li><li style=\"font-family:serif;margin-left:28.06pt;text-align:justify;padding-left:7.94pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Competitive pay hikes and bonus packages.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></li><li style=\"font-family:serif;margin-left:28.06pt;text-align:justify;padding-left:7.94pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Skill enhancement and growth opportunities.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></li><li style=\"font-family:serif;margin-left:28.06pt;text-align:justify;padding-left:7.94pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Equal opportunity employment.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></li><li style=\"font-family:serif;margin-left:28.06pt;text-align:justify;padding-left:7.94pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Health and wellbeing programmes.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></li><li style=\"font-family:serif;margin-left:28.06pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;padding-left:7.94pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Collaborative work with a truly global team.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">A Culture of Belonging</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">Synamedia is committed to promoting a diverse, inclusive and equal opportunity community\n- a place where we can all be ourselves and succeed. Our values connect us, and we love to win together. We work with a bias to action, have a bold approach and encourage being deeply curious to grow and evolve, as a team.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">In our aim to foster a people-friendly environment, we offer a range of family friendly, inclusive employment policies, flexible working arrangements, engagement activities and services to support all our colleagues across our 20 office locations. Synamedia regularly organises community events that promote cohesion and diversity among colleagues. We are proud of our mental health wellbeing initiatives, our Pride month awareness campaign, our cancer awareness programme and much more.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-weight:bold;font-size:14px;\">More information</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;color:rgb(19,19,19);text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\">If this role sparks your interest or any questions, or if you require any accommodations to be made to help you through your application, please reach out to our recruitment team, who would be happy to help.</span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:8pt;text-align:justify;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><div style=\"clear:both;\"><p style=\"margin-top:18pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"><span style=\"height:0pt;margin-top:-18pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p><table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:95.9%;margin-left:21.3pt;border-collapse:collapse;\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"border-left:1px solid #000000;width:30.74%;border-top:0.75pt solid #3380ff;vertical-align:bottom;\"><p style=\"margin-top:3pt;margin-bottom:3pt;font-size:6.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p></td><td style=\"border-left:1px solid #000000;width:55.94%;border-top:0.75pt solid #3380ff;vertical-align:bottom;\"><p style=\"margin-top:3pt;margin-left:48.25pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-indent:-48.25pt;text-align:right;font-size:7.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia;font-size:14px;\"> </span></p></td><td style=\"border-left:1px solid #000000;width:13.32%;border-top:0.75pt solid #3380ff;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-left:5.4pt;vertical-align:bottom;\"><p style=\"margin-top:3pt;margin-left:48.25pt;margin-bottom:3pt;text-indent:-48.25pt;